{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51100","headline":"奉和座主尚书避难过维阳宠示绝句三首（「阳」，疑当作「扬」。） 二 · 崔致远","name":"奉和座主尚书避难过维阳宠示绝句三首（「阳」，疑当作「扬」。） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱时无事不悲伤，鸾鳯惊飞出帝乡。\n应念浴沂诸弟子，每逢春色耿离肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}